{"version":1,"content":"<p>華人置業集團行政總裁兼執行董事、本地鈎織手作品牌及時裝品牌創辦人兼品牌設計師陳凱韻 （甘比），聯同城中名人何鍶珩、林心兒、林煒珽、柳王明琪、張新悅及崔乘飛等，出席護膚品牌活動。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:41:30.149119+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T13:10:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:19:38.392112+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T13:38:19.599024+00:00","content_hash":"984ef7d0677a362d2d5adce0fc94bdcac27d2827cd5fefa69aed5c6c4a6cc83c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}